  "abstract": "Audit and staged hardening of Xcode security build settings for Capacitor iOS apps and native plugin code: security compiler warnings, static analyzer checkers, Xcode Enhanced Security (hardened-process entitlements, pointer authentication / arm64e, hardware memory tagging), dependency compatibility for CocoaPods, SPM binary xcframeworks and Cordova plugins, and a persistent decision log.",
